OL,3,GNEWSATown's #22m revamp nears end as
OL,4,Abridge takes shape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #22m regeneration of a Kent town
OL,7,Fcentre is more than 90% complete as the
OL,8,Fconstruction of a new footbridge takes
OL,9,Fshape.
OL,11,FThe scheme, designed to improve the
OL,12,Froads around Folkestone Central railway
OL,13,Fstation and the town centre links, will
OL,14,Falso see a new green space replace the
OL,15,Fformer bus station at Bouverie Square.
OL,17,FFolkestone and Hythe District Council
OL,18,Fsaid the majority of the project, which
OL,19,Fhas involved work across seven sites,
OL,20,Fwill be finished by the end of the
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
