OL,3,GNEWSATown's #22m revamp nears end as
OL,4,Abridge takes shape
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor James Butcher said the
OL,7,Ffootbridge on Foresters Way will
OL,8,F"provide a new route into the heart of
OL,9,Fthe town and should increase footfall
OL,10,Falong Guildhall Street".
